## Infrastructure rules (applies when touching the server or Terraform)

Summary — see `fermrad/AI-tools/claude/rules/infrastructure.md` for the full list.

**Never:**
- Delete database volumes or run `docker volume rm` on any environment
- Run `terraform destroy` on production without written approval
- Commit secrets, tokens, or passwords to any repository
- Skip `terraform plan` before `terraform apply`
- Reload Nginx without first validating config with `nginx -t`

**Always before server changes:**
- Read `docs/ferm-tech-stack.md` in full
- Check `docker ps` to see what's actually running
- Test in development or staging before production

